 * Compute the average of values in a tabular dataset
 * for specified rows and columns
 * @param {Array<Array>} data - 2D array representing the dataset
 * @param {Array<number>} rows - Array of row indices (var1)
 * @param {Array<number>} columns - Array of column indices (var0)
